OL,3,AEvacuees from Russia-occupied city
OL,4,Awhere residents ate weeds arrive in
OL,5,AUkraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FPeople evacuated from the devastated
OL,8,FRussian-occupied city of Oleshky have
OL,9,Fcrossed into the Ukrainian controlled
OL,10,Fregion of Chernihiv, President
OL,11,FVolodymyr Zelensky has confirmed.
OL,13,FResidents of the frontline city had
OL,14,Fbeen trapped without food, water and
OL,15,Felectricity, with many resorting to
OL,16,Fcooking garden weeds to survive.
OL,18,FThe Ukrainian president thanked the US
OL,19,FFirst Lady Melania Trump for her
OL,20,Fefforts in brokering a local ceasefire
OL,21,Fthat paved the way for their evacuation
OL,22,Fon Friday.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
