OL,3,AEvacuees from Russia-occupied city
OL,4,Awhere residents ate weeds arrive in
OL,5,AUkraine
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe evacuees were taken via Russia and
OL,8,FBelarus before being driven across
OL,9,FUkraine's northern border on Saturday.
